The strongest rule is the colon completing an opening 'Title:' label.
Repository field tags, an opening 12, code introducers, escaped whitespace,
and punctuation leaders have smaller responses. Unmatched text stays near zero.
These rules do not attempt to explain its many small lexical fluctuations.
